The [[Rat Chef]] is a [[pet]] obtainable by combining a [[Rat]] and a [[Healing Herbs]]. This normally requires being [[Ranger]] and having [[Big Bowl of Treats]] to obtain the [[Rat]]. Its effects are completely different from the [[Rat]], gaining {{icon/regeneration}} for each [[food]] touching it, up to 6. Every once in a while it will regain stamina and give an {{icon/empower}}, faster for each touching [[food]] or [[pet]].

To get the most out of this [[pet]], the player will want several [[food]]s and higher than normal stamina-worth of [[weapon]]s.
